  "source_type": "website",
  "structure": {
    "block_count": 38,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block_000000",
        "block_index": 0,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Just so you know, What to Expect may earn commissions from the links included on this page. All sales and prices are accurate at the time of publishing.",
        "text_sha256": "2750b2f7f70af35175aee67cfbb0c80bcc1fb148d5036cad7d83e80e1d0c55e9",
        "word_count": 28
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Pregnancy announcements are undeniably adorable. They're a blend of happiness and a touch of relief when you finally get to share your life-altering news with loved ones. The ways to announce seem limitless: perhaps with a clever pun like \"here's the scoop,\" or through a tiny onesie that reflects the joy of soon meeting your little one. Either way, the cuteness factor is sure to be through the roof!",
        "text_sha256": "64e2e5ae19904aa5ee477631f21ea8a7703415812375b4dd73a3d4889e61e4b7",
        "word_count": 69
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "If you're looking to share your news in the most precious way possible, here are some of the cutest, most Aww-worthy pregnancy announcements for flower enthusiasts, ice cream aficionados and more.",
        "text_sha256": "e04a234e534b9568ac46096b4e9f7c89ef3575b613b3f3ac219b155b30b1a9e3",
        "word_count": 31
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "1. The most magical hour",
        "text_sha256": "0f05fdbd6d642d0286b072ea047cf3bc09a6fa3caf6bac35e90bc66cb22ad368",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "magical hour announcement",
        "text_sha256": "da0579abafaa4f4770ed21291698fc253130b042a86cb441a955cf2fbbf3269b",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "A blanket, sonogram and the whole family on a sprawling lawn … does it get any cuter than this shot by Pennsylvania-based photographer @marikphotography ? To tie it all together, mom Genesis added the sweetest caption: “and then there were five ?? grateful for the gift of life and family.”",
        "text_sha256": "504cecba8b1689c8697528a44b23b0c8d980c75dc2d407619ad3f103eb72866d",
        "word_count": 50
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "2. Mom and dad portraits",
        "text_sha256": "b7e6b7e22ed1f7ceb8afeb2bab91bceeeb96cf2a5c0abb6aa1ce4268c3498ef9",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "mom and dad annoucement",
        "text_sha256": "a986c27049d47e2aa7106cd628fa25ec33061e39d46fc2a2dd25e128f007f0e7",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "All eyes are on these parents’ beaming smiles and the growing bump in this series of black and white portraits. These are chic, timeless and oh-so-special.",
        "text_sha256": "b2dbffbe4816e42947fc89449d8d9c58d3192c30ad14b88a3bdba821d74dea80",
        "word_count": 26
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "3. Here’s the scoop",
        "text_sha256": "9549e8aa0c9b8058d7a08e897a5645bdaebc3d572a4f222c2375fb5ca98c417d",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "here's the scoop pregnancy announcement",
        "text_sha256": "0a00c5564d8e4ec23703942656593bd1401fbd1b6365bc8a6dbe196a1941f6eb",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "What’s sweeter than ice cream? This family shared the latest “scoop”: These two siblings are expecting a little sister – there isn't anything sweeter than that!",
        "text_sha256": "3c8adc1af69598e95f16541426aa1f25f81d9e0a3cc45137c0e59dd359514540",
        "word_count": 26
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "4. The writing’s on the wall",
        "text_sha256": "bca5c53833fab15c140f3e36c3a68f8d3a99d024f06961040a4dcb806c3a43ca",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "writing on the wall announcement",
        "text_sha256": "2398224121289b86b4e9c9aac213049897f16b540ee07f0b4841951c3218057a",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000014",
        "block_index": 14,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Whether you’re renovating your home or preparing baby’s room, you have the perfect photo opp, inspired by these happy parents-to-be.They used a soon-to-be-painted wall to paint \"Mom + Dad July '24\" and sat right underneath with their ultrasound to announce the news. Later on in the photoshoot, their dog joined in on the fun, too.",
        "text_sha256": "9cd9cec6eff411247764e9f06f356a9c390190a34b3e6fee07d6de0f852a4749",
        "word_count": 55
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000015",
        "block_index": 15,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "5. Extra, extra!",
        "text_sha256": "6f7aa24b3f571aa3f249bee08e68059967bd553e081696b3f13084bf9e64ddfc",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000016",
        "block_index": 16,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "extra extra announcement",
        "text_sha256": "1d1b6695aa750f2164ed58c670fc3df6a512e3a30c66250e0d981300e7cb810c",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000017",
        "block_index": 17,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The latest headline: You’re expecting! Spread the sweet news with this creative and customizable template from Etsy . You can personalize the newspaper from front to back so that every inch of the announcement is all about your sweet little bundle of joy.",
        "text_sha256": "5cb41eb38c847e1825bf6d2a34e9f07f7e46ece465869fc24faf14e63adc6568",
        "word_count": 43
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000018",
        "block_index": 18,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "6. New BFF on the way",
        "text_sha256": "1020355a7b77c01c6b5aff53fd2404e8db08aeda1c43608752e084be0af1a6df",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000019",
        "block_index": 19,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "new bff announcement",
        "text_sha256": "0d9fb8848a81bcf28c40c8d0f3d330246c90e02bc59aa2475b230ff6df2ece7f",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000020",
        "block_index": 20,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Your cute new best friend is coming soon! Say it with this onesie, which you can personalize with your due date and is sure to cue the smiles!",
        "text_sha256": "d36052e9602bc97fe7c2827320a16c5c6c40f6c9dd8f1705c9c88e2a64709c07",
        "word_count": 28
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000021",
        "block_index": 21,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "7. Tu-lips are sealed no more",
        "text_sha256": "8977c5b443be1ee3db557041332b77a418919e1b5da17e8bf7587d6866079365",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000022",
        "block_index": 22,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "tulips pregnancy announcement",
        "text_sha256": "88c268647eb7e8a9500b60769ea0f3ab1fd5b092d7850a3e45e0d0abecb3caad",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000023",
        "block_index": 23,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Digital templates allow you to quickly and beautifully announce the upcoming arrival of your little one. This one features a delicate blanket (what's more darling?), bouquet of white tulips and a space for your own sonogram, baby name and due date.",
        "text_sha256": "45ac0f852ec1942c776c1084b983eba8ad8268a615de6a3c44c0f88e5b67e4a4",
        "word_count": 41
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000024",
        "block_index": 24,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "8. Fuss-free family announcement",
        "text_sha256": "c082f2afe8910c8cc5d6455dda2e88416a3c689bc18fb8904a6597e78e8331ba",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000025",
        "block_index": 25,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "fuss free family announcement",
        "text_sha256": "243627e7bd64153e0f9d28892ff04259c2b82ac7b9ccb69a176abdcba04b44ff",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000026",
        "block_index": 26,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "For a more outdoorsy feel, this customizable digital template dons baby’s last name and your due date on a clothesline that's set in front of the most beautiful scenery. Within two hours, you’ll have a whimsical, realistic-looking and incredibly cute pregnancy announcement.",
        "text_sha256": "76cf0370632e20799987a00a09e5d6b6f9a14ad6b805183f410aac818b0aa0fc",
        "word_count": 42
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000027",
        "block_index": 27,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "9. Sweet signage",
        "text_sha256": "18224909594ae68ba2228ada6cc95d634faae8717b81060252f47513b48c7e6c",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000028",
        "block_index": 28,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "sweet signage announcement",
        "text_sha256": "9a6325ded5a15178636f4cf14cc44d77e5923a8ad41cb5bfd46b712c42405c1e",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000029",
        "block_index": 29,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dreaming of a digital flat-lay design? Order one of these wooden due date plaques , which will include your baby’s last name and the month and year you’re due. Just pair it with some adorable props — like the example here – because there's really nothing cuter!",
        "text_sha256": "7124fc929b9ae12e34e7c42f4bdd0e25cfa70d83bd59053c168918130d74aae4",
        "word_count": 47
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000030",
        "block_index": 30,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "10. Stuffie with a surprise",
        "text_sha256": "0cbe1be83ba3ee7eac3a21e6a97f09aa01e0ead73542d1ff0f67edee82792755",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000031",
        "block_index": 31,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "stuffie with a surprise",
        "text_sha256": "9f12a3e24feb9146ba70c7c1b265c6f061cd00ac6322f18b5c0e09b4445784ca",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000032",
        "block_index": 32,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Order this personalized elephant stuffed animal , complete with baby’s last name and due date, and then surprise everyone with your big news. And then when your LO arrives, she’ll have a new lovey (which, by the way, is the cutest way to cuddle up with your bundle of joy!).",
        "text_sha256": "f71a5611ce614631c01fe346ffc6cc3d39ac3981637a94107ab9b7456de16afa",
        "word_count": 50
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000033",
        "block_index": 33,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "good fortune announcement",
        "text_sha256": "a1223a5b616dd69eb319c28f5f909605de1bcfe4d58d586df9a991e4d94dd6f0",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000034",
        "block_index": 34,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "You’ve never felt more fortunate, so it only makes sense to announce your pregnancy to family and friends with these custom-made fortune cookies . How clever and cute! Sneak these into your takeout bag and wait for the big reveal!",
        "text_sha256": "cabb5dec95cb93cfd5dc07fde54d2a05113b0ec40a7848d7de9d26f59bc3c31c",
        "word_count": 40
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000035",
        "block_index": 35,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "12. Foodie favorite",
        "text_sha256": "9869eac4c599426d88d2df3d131b0e1807a4fdd44db33c8d7d9d9cae998f2833",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000036",
        "block_index": 36,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "food favorite announcement",
        "text_sha256": "807d237310972e2c6517ac297a54b2c2e3c5374eb4510a4845d968528a001399",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000037",
        "block_index": 37,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Another delicious yet super sweet pregnancy announcement? These two stork cookies from Etsy, which you can personalize with your own due date and give out to friends and family.",
        "text_sha256": "b81179e96fb3f861a61fbad6837c7de78b8ee8210c181fdaf87414e6d3f99176",
        "word_count": 29
      }
    ],
    "content_word_count": 698,
    "heading_count": 11
  },
  "title": "12 Cute Pregnancy Announcements to Celebrate Your Bundle of Joy",
